<h1>Nonprofit Membership Management Software</h1>

<p class="lead">Nonprofit membership management software for volunteer coordination, events, dues, and donations — without enterprise prices or SaaS lock-in.</p>

<img src="/images/ss-calendar.png" alt="Nonprofit workflow calendar with volunteer shifts and donor tracking" width="827" height="827" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;max-width:560px;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;" class="rounded border">

<section id="why-nonprofit" class="card" aria-labelledby="why-nonprofit-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="why-nonprofit-heading">Built for how nonprofits actually run</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>Community organizations juggle roster, shifts, events, and books — usually across a volunteer’s spreadsheet, a group chat, and someone’s memory. GatherPack puts them in one open-source platform so the organization owns the data, not a single gatekeeper. Start with the <a href="/features/members/">roster</a>, add <a href="/features/events/">events and time tracking</a> when service days ramp up, then layer <a href="/features/finance/">dues and donations</a> when you need them.</p>
    <p class="mb-0">Self-host free under the <a href="https://github.com/GatherPack/gatherpack/blob/main/LICENSE" target="_blank" rel="noopener">MIT license</a> or hand hosting to <a href="https://sledgehammerinfosystems.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Sledgehammer Infosystems</a>. <a href="/open-source/">Compare options</a> · <a href="/hosting/">See pricing</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="tailored" class="card" aria-labelledby="tailored-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="tailored-heading">Tailored for community orgs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <div class="row g-4">

      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 d-flex">
        <div class="feature-card w-100">
          <div class="feature-card__icon">
            <i class="fa-4x fa-solid fa-people-group" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card__body">
            <h3>Volunteers &amp; teams</h3>
            <p>One searchable roster with teams and sub-teams — limit access so a committee only sees its slice. Managers handle their own content and attendance. <a href="/features/members/">Member details →</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 d-flex">
        <div class="feature-card w-100">
          <div class="feature-card__icon">
            <i class="fa-4x fa-solid fa-calendar-days" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card__body">
            <h3>Events, RSVPs &amp; shifts</h3>
            <p>Post service days and meetings; let volunteers RSVP, pick shifts, and check in. Custom fields handle what you actually need — roles, carpools, t-shirt sizes. <a href="/features/events/">Explore events →</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 d-flex">
        <div class="feature-card w-100">
          <div class="feature-card__icon">
            <i class="fa-4x fa-solid fa-clock" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card__body">
            <h3>Volunteer hours</h3>
            <p>Track time through the kiosk (PIN/barcode/RFID) and report by period for grants and school service requirements. Bulk clock-out when the day wraps. <a href="/features/automation/">Reports →</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 d-flex">
        <div class="feature-card w-100">
          <div class="feature-card__icon">
            <i class="fa-4x fa-solid fa-hand-holding-dollar" aria-hidden="true"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="feature-card__body">
            <h3>Dues, donations &amp; books</h3>
            <p>Keep the ledger alongside the roster — tagged transactions, receipts, and Stripe-powered online payments in one place. Zeffy/PayPal/Venmo on the <a href="/roadmap/">roadmap</a>. <a href="/features/finance/">Finance →</a></p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="communication" class="card" aria-labelledby="communication-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="communication-heading">Communication that reaches the right people</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <p>Announcements go to the right teams — not everyone’s inbox. Schedule posts to appear and expire, send weekly digests, and keep handbooks on content pages instead of buried threads. <a href="/features/communication/">How announcements work →</a></p>
    <p class="mb-0">Sibling use cases with similar needs: <a href="/use-cases/churches/">churches</a> (congregation + small groups), <a href="/use-cases/youth-clubs/">youth clubs</a> (families + schedules), <a href="/use-cases/sports-leagues/">sports leagues</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

