<section id="faq" class="card" aria-labelledby="faq-heading">
  <div class="card-header">
    <h2 id="faq-heading">Nonprofit FAQs</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="card-body">
    <h3 class="h5">Can non-technical volunteers use this?</h3>
    <p>Yes — day-to-day roster, events, and announcements are designed for non-technical leaders. Deeper custom reports are code-based today (with a no-code builder on the <a href="/roadmap/">roadmap</a>).</p>
    <h3 class="h5">Do we need to self-host?</h3>
    <p>Only if you want to. MIT self-host is free for control and privacy; managed hosting at $50/mo standard or $100/mo custom handles updates, backups, and payments for you. <a href="/open-source/">Self-host details</a> · <a href="/hosting/">Hosting</a></p>
    <h3 class="h5">Can we track volunteer hours for grants?</h3>
    <p>Yes — kiosk check-in with period-based reports is built for that. Export or use <a href="/features/automation/">custom reports</a> to roll up hours by team and period.</p>
    <p class="mb-0"><a href="/faq/">All FAQs →</a> · <a href="/features/">Browse features</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

